    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Key information",
     "texto": [
      "**Length and route**: Start at the car park, about two hours following the red markers to the bridge and then climbing through the wood.",
      "**Water**: There are no drinking fountains; you must carry your own water bottle.",
      "**Exception for bad weather**: In heavy rain, it is forbidden to wade across the bridge; you must take the paved detour through the village.",
      "**Rules for animals and works**: Dogs only on a leash; the summit stretch is closed until Friday, with a compulsory stop at the hut."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
